Looking at this problem, I need to identify the function $f$ and count its fixed points up to 1988.

## Step 1: Compute initial values and conjecture

Computing $f$ for small values:

| $n$ | binary | $f(n)$ | $f(n)=n$? |
|-----|--------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | 1 | 1 | ✓ |
| 3 | 11 | 3 | ✓ |
| 5 | 101 | 5 | ✓ |
| 7 | 111 | 7 | ✓ |
| 9 | 1001 | 9 | ✓ |
| 11 | 1011 | 13 | ✗ |
| 13 | 1101 | 11 | ✗ |
| 15 | 1111 | 15 | ✓ |
